# Error handling

RulePackVersion: 1.3.0

- Flag empty catch blocks and swallowed exceptions.
- Flag defensive null checks on every internal private call when serialized refs should be validated at startup.
- Flag exceptions for expected gameplay rejection paths; prefer Try/bool + reason enum.
- Validate external/untrusted input at boundaries; do not require blanket null guards on internal helpers.